Bio:
Pensions Advisor and Expert - worked in UK DB pensions for over 25 years, advising Trustees, Companies and led the innovation of new solutions for clients. Now putting these skills to use along with my broader management and leadership skills below to be part of the highly successful L&G Pension Risk Transfer team. 

Previous roles include:
- Chief Operating Officer for a global Wealth Solutions business (£1bn+ revenue);
- UK Board Director and SMF of FCA regulated entities; 
- running a P&L;
- being accountability for new client Solutions;
- advising clients (often at C-Suite level) about their pension plan strategy; and
- a Trustee of a £4 billion pension scheme.

I have a passion for helping others to achieve goals, making a marked difference to people, organisations, and their clients. Proven expertise in developing and implementing strategic change programmes in operational efficiency/effectiveness, risk assessment and mitigation, operational governance, colleague communication, real estate, business applications, business continuity and colleague health, safety, and wellbeing. This drives colleague engagement but also colleague productivity and effectiveness, ultimately resulting in excellent service delivery to clients.

Pension Trustee Board Chair with global experience in investment, pensions and risk management, passionate about ensuring pension funds and financial institutions can deliver on their promises to members and customers.

Skilled in 
- developing strategic solutions;
- analytical thinking;
- improving risk management; and 
- managing key stakeholder relationships
